  "protocol": "Eight full-booking holdouts on train.csv; no test data, labels or pretrained weights. The untouched author DenseBlock stacks two densely connected layers of 32 ODST, depth 4, 2 response dimensions, entmax15 feature selectors and entmoid15 routing. Trained locally with a 50-epoch AdamW schedule; this compact CPU training recipe differs from the paper benchmarks. Raw unnamed fields, known order size and spend summaries; one-hot categories and training-only marginal quantiles. The ordinary asymmetric histogram-boosted tree uses the same features. Archive CatBoost has its own existing feature policy. The six existing challenger blocks include the three TabNet recipes. Prior-countervote counts use distinct_challenger_error_reach_n26.population.",
